2. switch to lab-mail server config
3. clean up vestigial jj maildir

> b) Sending address: pat@p7x.dev or pat@patmaddox.com? Is either one
>    already a sending identity on the Fastmail account behind
>    mail-creds?

Well that's what I was asking about. pat@patmaddox.com is my primary
